    "bodyClass": "",
    "mainHtml": "<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">About</div><h1>Connecting AI delivery with institutional responsibility</h1><p class=\"support\">MIZAN is being developed through Arrownex's AI for Public Purpose Lab in the UAE. The Lab brings applied research and institutional assurance into practical AI delivery for government and regulated organisations.</p></div></section>\n      <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"people-title\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">People</div><h2 id=\"people-title\" class=\"section-heading medium\">Named leadership behind MIZAN</h2><div class=\"grid-2\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><article class=\"person-card\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">TM</div><div><h3>Tariq Makadi</h3><p><strong>Co-founder and institutional governance lead.</strong></p><p>Brings experience in privacy, AI governance and digital public infrastructure to MIZAN's design. As a doctoral researcher at UCL's Institute for Innovation and Public Purpose, he researches the relationship between digital infrastructure, institutions and legitimacy.</p></div></article><article class=\"person-card\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">SK</div><div><h3>Sujit Kumar</h3><p><strong>Co-founder and Arrownex delivery lead.</strong></p><p>Leads Arrownex's technology delivery, partnerships and customer relationships, connecting the venture to engineering and operational capability.</p></div></article></div></div></section>\n      <section class=\"section light\" aria-labelledby=\"relationships-title\"><div class=\"container prose\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Operating relationships</div><h2 id=\"relationships-title\" class=\"section-heading medium\">Arrownex, the Lab and institutional responsibility</h2><p>Arrownex provides the operating and delivery platform. The AI for Public Purpose Lab develops and tests the methods and product proposition. The institution using MIZAN keeps responsibility for its AI approval decisions.</p><p class=\"source-note\">Any IIPI relationship statement should be confirmed before stronger public wording is used. No endorsement, backing or institutional partnership is implied here.</p></div></section>"
