    "mainHtml": "<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Supporting instrument</div><h1>Institutional capability</h1><p class=\"support\">Qudra examines whether the organisation has the mandate, people, processes and supervision needed for this AI use.</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"/contact/\">Discuss a pilot</a><a class=\"button secondary\" href=\"/ecosystem/\">Supporting instruments</a></div></div></section><section class=\"section light\"><div class=\"container split-grid\"><div><div class=\"section-kicker\">Explore capability</div><h2 class=\"section-heading medium\">Strengthening one approval case at a time</h2><p class=\"section-lede\">Mandate, people, process, data controls, supervision, transparency, contestability and monitoring are treated as evidence for one approval case.</p></div><div class=\"note-card\"><h3>Availability</h3><p>Availability and pilot scope should be agreed with the MIZAN team. This page does not state or imply formal credential, customer deployment or software-granted approval.</p></div></div></section>"
